   "text": "---\nid: D-2026-001\ntitle: Fokus pada Loonars 1 & 2; nonaktifkan cabang Makassar, Jabodetabek, Kendari\ndate: 2026-11-01\nstatus: PROPOSED   # IMPORTED dari Mkhsistem CURRENT_STATE.md (migrasi 0310); perlu konfirmasi founder\nconfirmed_at:\nconfirmed_by:\nreview_on: NEEDS DATA\nlines: [Holding, L1, L2]\nanalysis:\nsupersedes:\n---\n\n# Fokus pada Loonars 1 & 2\n\n## Business context\nNEEDS DATA — alasan bisnis tidak tercatat di repo sumber.\n## Founder proposal\nHanya Loonars 1 (hospitality Yogyakarta) & Loonars 2 (Loonars Living) yang aktif; karyawan cabang Makassar, Jabodetabek, Kendari dinonaktifkan (tanpa menghapus data). [HISTORICAL · Mkhsistem CURRENT_STATE.md, migrasi 0310; mkh-properti migrasi 0060]\n## AI board analysis\nBelum ada (keputusan diambil sebelum advisor ada).\n## Identified risks\nNEEDS DATA\n## Alternatives considered\nNEEDS DATA\n## Final decision\nSudah dieksekusi di sistem per 2026-11-01. Kata-kata founder: NEEDS DATA.\n## Expected outcome\nNEEDS DATA — usulan KPI: beban gaji holding, kas grup 6 bulan, fokus waktu founder.\n## Actual outcome\n## Lessons learned\n"
